<Legal title="Privacy policy" description="How AgentFlow Media collects, uses and protects your personal information." updated="9 November 2026">
  <p>This policy explains what personal information AgentFlow Media collects when you use this website or book a call with us, what we do with it, and the choices you have. We follow South Africa's Protection of Personal Information Act (POPIA) for everyone we deal with, in Namibia and South Africa.</p>

  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>AgentFlow Media is a marketing business based in Namibia. We help real estate agents get more listing appointments. The owner of AgentFlow Media is responsible for your information and acts as our information officer.</p>
  <p>You can reach us at <a href="mailto:theagentflowmedia@gmail.com">theagentflowmedia@gmail.com</a> or on WhatsApp at <a href="https://wa.me/264816780891">+264 81 678 0891</a>.</p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>When you book a call:</strong> your name, email address, phone number, the time you choose, and anything you add on the booking form.</li>
    <li><strong>When you message us:</strong> your name, number and what you write to us on WhatsApp or by email.</li>
    <li><strong>When you visit the site:</strong> our hosting provider keeps basic technical logs, such as your IP address and browser type, to keep the site running and secure.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We don't use analytics, advertising trackers or cookies of our own on this website. The booking calendar is provided by Google Calendar and may use cookies it needs to work.</p>

  <h2>Why we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To book, confirm and hold your strategy call.</li>
    <li>To reply to your messages and answer your questions.</li>
    <li>To follow up with you about our services after you've asked us to contact you.</li>
    <li>If you become a client, to deliver the work we agree on.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We only use your information for these purposes. We don't sell it or rent it to anyone.</p>

  <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
  <p>We use a few trusted service providers to run our business. They only get the information they need to do their job:</p>
  <ul>
        <li><strong>WhatsApp (Meta)</strong>, when you message us there.</li>
    <li><strong>Google</strong>, which runs our booking calendar, email and video calls.</li>
    <li><strong>Netlify</strong>, which hosts this website.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Some of these providers store data on servers outside Namibia and South Africa. We only use providers that protect personal information to a standard similar to POPIA.</p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>If you book a call but don't become a client, we delete your details within 12 months of our last contact with you. If you become a client, we keep your information for as long as we work together and for any period the law requires after that.</p>

  <h2>How we protect it</h2>
  <p>We keep your information in password-protected accounts that only we can access, and we use reputable providers with their own security measures. No system is perfectly secure, but we take reasonable steps to prevent loss, misuse or unauthorised access.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>You can ask us at any time to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>tell you what information we hold about you,</li>
    <li>correct anything that's wrong,</li>
    <li>delete your information,</li>
    <li>stop contacting you about our services.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Email <a href="mailto:theagentflowmedia@gmail.com">theagentflowmedia@gmail.com</a> or WhatsApp us and we'll respond within 30 days. If you're not happy with how we've handled your information, you can complain to South Africa's Information Regulator at <a href="https://inforegulator.org.za" target="_blank" rel="noopener">inforegulator.org.za</a>.</p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>If we change this policy, we'll update it on this page and change the date at the top.</p>
</Legal>
